  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the NAO Office and Implementation of the 11th EDF National Indicative Programme (NIP) Projects in the various MDAs, NSAs and Local Authorities (TCF-VI)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Support to the NAO Office and Implementation of the 11th EDF National Indicative Programme (NIP) Projects in the various MDAs, NSAs and Local Authorities (TCF-VI) - The purpose of this project is to support the identification and implementation of  actions under the NIP and other EU programmes and to improve awareness in Sierra Leone of issues related to development cooperation and EU policies.</narrative>
  </description>
